~Version ---------------------------------------------------
VERS.   2.0 : CWLS log ASCII Standard -VERSION 2.0
WRAP.    NO : One line per depth step
DLM . SPACE : Column Data Section Delimiter
~Well ------------------------------------------------------
STRT.M           1949.90000 : START DEPTH
STOP.M           2847.80000 : STOP DEPTH
STEP.M              0.00000 : STEP
NULL.               -999.25 : NULL VALUE
COMP.           Norsk Hydro : COMPANY
WELL.              35/11-10 : WELL
FLD .                       : FIELD
LOC .                       : LOCATION
PROV.                       : PROVINCE
CNTY.                       : COUNTY
STAT.                       : STATE
CTRY.                Norway : COUNTRY
SRVC.      Schlumberger MDT : SERVICE COMPANY
DATE. 1997-06-04/1997-06-19 : DATE
UWI .                       : UNIQUE WELL ID
API .                       : API NUMBER
~Curve Information -----------------------------------------
DEPT       .M      : TVD below MSL, positive down (TVD RKB minus 22 m)
MD         .M      : Measured depth from RKB
PRES       .BAR    : MDT formation pressure, quartz (CQG) gauge
PRES_STRAIN.BAR    : MDT formation pressure, strain gauge
HYD_BEFORE .BAR    : Initial hydrostatic (mud) pressure, quartz gauge; not formation pressure
HYD_AFTER  .BAR    : Final hydrostatic (mud) pressure, quartz gauge
TEMP       .DEGC   : Test temperature
MOBILITY   .MD/CP  : Pretest drawdown mobility
RUN        .       : MDT run: 11=1A 12=1B 13=1C 24=2D 25=2E
TEST       .       : Test number within the run
QC         .       : Test quality: 0 valid pressure, 2 tight (no pressure), 3 failed (plugged probe, temperature not stabilized, aborted)
SAMPLE     .       : 1 sampling station, 0 pretest
~Params ----------------------------------------------------
DREF   .                                     TVD MSL : Positive down; first index is TVD below MSL, not measured depth
RKB_MSL.M                                       22.0 : RKB elevation above MSL
SOURCE .                                 Norsk Hydro : Sodir wellbore 3042, MDT runs 1A-2E
PREF   .                                         BAR : Absolute/gauge reference not stated
~Other -----------------------------------------------------
Irregular stations; STEP=0. MDT pressure stations, one stabilized pressure per test; no fluid interpretation is included. Sampling stations repeat the depth of a pretest. See README.md.
~ASCII -----------------------------------------------------
